nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTnADWZdlJ5RBlw21ze2-6ZNWOEVnOp2avZmuKRcocDBg&oe=6AFDD7B9"}, {"file_name": "01_courtyard.png", "id": "1761722711868587", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823949_1761722718535253_5650280468569959244_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K6d5K0hM0AsQ7kNvwExjo7_&_nc_oc=AdpoL-vWmQ1goEugpjOtjKSx61f-b37H_6UV9X9o8n12Mpib6zEAh5NNR8Be3MxUN0g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQjGmatpRYaRE_I7JZRty4g8R3IGXJH1pHaMuPoBz_Fdw&oe=6AFDC184"}, {"file_name": "03_kabak.png", "id": "2137822273837377", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821796_2137822277170710_5649736202398466332_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DQkAQBwFT4kQ7kNvwHVUPCO&_nc_oc=Adogl4HAOdeP0ZpV8D9ZP2HcVswK0aF2OqDYTY2BP4gBKOpX9kxvei45jRVEUHxYgp8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS4vHMXFl78jypCLKLHhOAk9ZVir8aMAGi2KNozdt7mAg&oe=6AFDB6DF"}, {"file_name": "04_darb.png", "id": "1670253031194707", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823901_1670253034528040_6147702725093439108_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B-v8n85hgSgQ7kNvwHggMBr&_nc_oc=AdoxSiZTOjTHHhvVufoaQ65ytksdlqZHIQSFpFDCeiC8VjuDfDk6bExpV4BT8v6jf7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTYiWjtjaFAeflx8La4fvWkLRxdFXRn7ZnZGp07GkkO0A&oe=6AFDD33F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "2608365686265810", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_2608365689599143_8422926958870631352_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tiYVcokoSEwQ7kNvwGz2Kt7&_nc_oc=AdqwtL9qTq4ZOtqMYXzwSgI-jyOECDnL4K0TpLC-L1ndn2RDxMKXd4uM5PZu0oDE66o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRGN_g4TqTlWL_wGyWo_J8GVLlESIu5iYyKPgPbl3wzRg&oe=6AFDBC3C"}, "display_name": "Seljuk Archery VR - Sel\u00e7uklu Ok\u00e7ulu\u011fu", "keywords": ["ok\u00e7uluk", "sel\u00e7uklu", "sel\u00e7ukluok\u00e7ulu\u011fu", "avc\u0131l\u0131k", "okveyay"], "long_description": "Sel\u00e7uklu Ok\u00e7ulu\u011fu, geleneksel T\u00fcrk ok\u00e7ulu\u011funu Sel\u00e7uklu esintili bir avluda Meta Quest'e ta\u015f\u0131yor. K\u0131sa ama g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc kompozit T\u00fcrk yay\u0131n\u0131 elinize al\u0131n ve kiri\u015fi, eski ok\u00e7ular gibi zihgirli ba\u015fparma\u011f\u0131n\u0131zla \u00e7ekin.\n\nTAL\u0130M YOLU: 7 B\u00d6L\u00dcM, 28 A\u015eAMA\n\u2022 Puta: halka hedef, hareketli hedef ve 13 metreye kadar geleneksel puta\n\u2022 Kabak: dire\u011fin tepesindeki kaba\u011f\u0131 vurun; s\u00fcreye kar\u015f\u0131 ve r\u00fczg\u00e2rda\n\u2022 Darb: levhalar\u0131 ve deri kalkan\u0131 delin; yaln\u0131zca g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc bir \u00e7eki\u015f ge\u00e7er\n\u2022 Menzil: a\u00e7\u0131k meydana \u00e7\u0131k\u0131n, okunuzu 100 metrenin \u00f6tesine g\u00f6nderin\n\u2022 Ustal\u0131k: r\u00fczg\u00e2r, as\u0131l\u0131 deri ve 10 hedefli Usta S\u0131nav\u0131\n\u2022 Usta Yolu: \u0130cazetname ile a\u00e7\u0131lan alt\u0131 zor a\u015fama\n\u2022 \u015eenlik Meydan\u0131: testi k\u0131r\u0131n, havadaki kaba\u011f\u0131 vurun, sallanan halkadan ge\u00e7irin, \u00e7arkta \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131lan rengi bulun, ak\u015famda mum s\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcn ve ustay\u0131 yenin\nY\u0131ld\u0131z toplayarak a\u015famalar\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131n, \u0130cazetnamenizi al\u0131n; \u00c7\u0131rakl\u0131ktan Sultan'\u0131n Kemanke\u015fi unvan\u0131na y\u00fckselin.\n\nTE\u00c7H\u0130ZAT\nA\u00e7\u0131lacak d\u00f6rt yay, \u00fc\u00e7 ok ve alt\u0131 kaftan.\n\nSERBEST TAL\u0130M\nHalka hedef, puta ve bonus ustal\u0131k talimi.\n\nHER OK\u00c7U \u0130\u00c7\u0130N\n\u2022 Solak ya da sa\u011flak: yay, onu hangi elinizle al\u0131rsan\u0131z o ele ge\u00e7er\n\u2022 Oturarak oynama, boy ayar\u0131 ve iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131 ni\u015fan \u00e7izgisi\n\u2022 T\u00fcrk\u00e7e ve \u0130ngilizce\n\nKURUMLAR VE ETK\u0130NL\u0130KLER \u0130\u00c7\u0130N\nEtkinlik Modu m\u00fczeler, okullar ve festivaller i\u00e7in tasarland\u0131: ziyaret\u00e7i k\u0131sa bir rehberle hemen ba\u015flar, g\u00f6zl\u00fck ba\u015fkas\u0131na verilince tur yeniden ba\u015flar, g\u00fcn\u00fcn en iyileri duvarda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr ve ayarlar PIN ile korunur. Avludaki tabelaya kurumunuzun ad\u0131n\u0131 yazabilirsiniz.", "short_description": "Sel\u00e7uklu esintili bir avluya ad\u0131m at\u0131n; kompozit T\u00fcrk yay\u0131 ve ba\u015fparmak \u00e7eki\u015fiyle geleneksel T\u00fcrk ok\u00e7ulu\u011funu \u00f6\u011frenin. Putay\u0131 vurun, dire\u011fin tepesindeki kaba\u011f\u0131 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcr\u00fcn, g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc \u00e7eki\u015fle levhalar\u0131 delin ve okunuzu a\u00e7\u0131k meydanda menzile g\u00f6nderin. 28 a\u015famal\u0131 Talim Yolu'nda y\u0131ld\u0131z toplay\u0131n, \u015fenlikte testi k\u0131r\u0131p mum s\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcn, \u0130cazetnamenizi al\u0131n; yeni yaylar, oklar ve kaftanlar a\u00e7\u0131n. Oyunda ayr\u0131ca Serbest Talim ve m\u00fcze, okul, festival gibi etkinlikler i\u00e7in Etkinlik Modu var."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "2228416987889323", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_2228416991222656_8991530152515408054_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cPlydmcHoOUQ7kNvwGMCYnG&_nc_oc=Ado2v_wEI3dwzuH7pMo5wShsS19UytOYK33k6yrhtG59u0a_YclkFGsZfgoBRQsW12c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSobNQzBTt7TlZAboZSg0HA8JDEm91nt3DYcnHkGTk0Fw&oe=6AFDC711"}, {"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE.png", "id": "1647537243638660", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1647537256971992_1006404755865380296_n.png?_nc_cat=