DRMQ7kNvwFiCQog&_nc_oc=AdpCrCTOgnLA7W2ebbI-M8CXqQqGmhWwHaSB3hShP8UGkXGACGDPcucFOndJUtipGPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRTe-y8fm_1oKSeWyrGemIXqob9RddG0tlMeLqqYL6h0Q&oe=6AFDC6EB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1878997873092910", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1878997876426243_5042016510771434414_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GBow_B2H4kcQ7kNvwEKjsvx&_nc_oc=AdqSyt-MD1r0bivrjIP92LCurjgmcISC4W2NIDksbCqBTg3JiYfgKxj5f2GDIm9-YJc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSI4n5W2J1XrMC8HCeQZYNztw7-TvVpWuUDGHAPHNLEuQ&oe=6AFDDE76"}, "display_name": "Seljuk Archery VR - Sel\u00e7uklu Ok\u00e7ulu\u011fu", "keywords": ["history", "archery", "traditionalarchery", "targetshooting"], "long_description": "Seljuk Archery VR brings traditional Turkish archery to Meta Quest, in a Seljuk-style courtyard. Hold a short, powerful composite bow and draw the string with your thumb, protected by a zihgir (thumb ring), like the archers of old.\n\nTRAINING PATH: 28 STAGES IN 7 CHAPTERS\n\u2022 Puta: ring targets, moving targets and the traditional puta up to 13 m\n\u2022 Kabak: shoot the gourd off the pole, against the clock and in the wind\n\u2022 Darb: pierce boards and a leather shield; only a strong draw gets through\n\u2022 Menzil: send arrows past 100 m on the open field\n\u2022 Ustal\u0131k: wind, hanging leather and the 10-target Master Exam\n\u2022 Master's Path: six harder stages that open with the \u0130cazetname\n\u2022 Festival Square: break jugs, hit gourds in the air, shoot through a swinging ring, find the called color, put out candles at dusk and beat the master\nEarn stars to unlock stages, receive your \u0130cazetname (the archer's license) and rise from Apprentice to the Sultan's Archer.\n\nEQUIPMENT\nFour bows, three arrows and six kaftans to unlock.\n\nFREE PRACTICE\nRing target, puta and a bonus round.\n\nFOR EVERY ARCHER\n\u2022 Left- or right-handed: the bow goes to the hand that picks it up\n\u2022 Seated play, height adjustment and an optional aim line\n\u2022 Turkish and English\n\nFOR VENUES AND EVENTS\nEvent Mode is made for museums, schools and festivals: visitors start at once with a short guide, the round restarts when the headset is passed on, today's best scores hang on the wall and a PIN protects the settings.", "short_description": "Step into a Seljuk-style courtyard and learn traditional Turkish archery with a composite bow and a thumb draw. Hit the puta, shoot the gourd off the top of the pole, pierce boards with a strong draw and send your arrows far across the open field. Earn stars on the 28-stage Training Path, break jugs and put out candles at the festival, receive your \u0130cazetname and unlock new bows, arrows and kaftans. Includes Free Practice and an Event Mode for museums, schools and festivals."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seljukarchery-privacy/ana-sayfa", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DorukTech", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/seljukarchery-privacy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "tr"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1311024542097053"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1157885033474502"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1157885033474502"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1790788080, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1157885033474502"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1318543728011801", "version": "2.0"}, "id": "1452651830061379", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1311024525430388", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1318543728011801"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1452651830061379"}]}, "change_log": "English\nVersion 2.0 \u2022 Chapter 8, Frontier Fort: signal fires, embrasures, the drawbridge and the night watch \u2022 Chapter 9, Caravanserai: jars, glazed plates, glass and pomegranates that shatter, stacks of pots that fall, a sealed jar full of gold \u2022 Chapter 10, Alaiye Harbour: barrels on the waves, sails to cut down, the Red Tower's bells, lantern boats at dusk, a target on a raft and a pirate ship at night \u2022 Chapter 11, the Snowy Pass: icicles that fall and shatter, snowmen, ice sculptures, sleds on a frozen lake, snowballs and a blizzard \u2022 Chapter 12, Cappadocia: evil-eye beads, clay discs from a dovecote, shields in rock windows, rolling wheels and balanced stones \u2022 Chapters 1-5 now have five stages each: 67 stages in 12 chapters \u2022 Daily Challenge: a new stage every day, the same for everyone \u2022 Badges: twelve to earn, shown on the courtyard wall \u2022 Siege, Shooting Range and Bazaar Shoot under Free Practice \u2022 New equipment: new bows, arrows that hold their line in the wind, and a kaftan for every new rank \u2022 Archery notes to collect on the stage briefings \u2022 The feel of a shot: haptics on the draw and release, hit sounds by material, bending limbs, an arrow camera for long shots \u2022 A new look: textured stone and wood, soft shadows, dusk and starry nights, birds, onlookers and a master archer who shoots \u2022 Event Mode: the venue picks the visitors' game (classic training or one of six games) and starts it with Start the Event \u2022 Many fixes\n\nT\u00fcrk\u00e7e\nS\u00fcr\u00fcm 2.0 \u2022 8. b\u00f6l\u00fcm U\u00e7 Kalesi: i\u015faret ate\u015fleri, mazgallar, asma k\u00f6pr\u00fc ve gece n\u00f6beti \u2022 9. b\u00f6l\u00fcm Kervansaray: k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131p sa\u00e7\u0131lan k\u00fcpler, \u00e7ini tabaklar, cam \u015fi\u015feler ve narlar, devrilen \u00e7\u00f6mlek kuleleri, alt\u0131n dolu m\u00fch\u00fcrl\u00fc k\u00fcp \u2022 10. b\u00f6l\u00fcm Al\u00e2iye Liman\u0131: dalgadaki f\u0131\u00e7\u0131lar, kesilen yelken halatlar\u0131, K\u0131z\u0131l Kule'nin \u00e7anlar\u0131, ak\u015fam fener kay\u0131klar\u0131, saldaki hedef ve gece korsan gemisi \u2022 11. b\u00f6l\u00fcm Karl\u0131 Ge\u00e7it: d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcp par\u00e7alanan buz sark\u0131tlar\u0131, kardan adamlar, buz heykeller, donmu\u015f g\u00f6lde k\u0131zaklar, kartoplar\u0131 ve tipi \u2022 12. b\u00f6l\u00fcm Kapadokya: nazar boncuklar\u0131, g\u00fcvercinlikten f\u0131rlayan kil diskler, kaya pencerelerinde kalkanlar, yuvarlanan tekerlekler ve denge ta\u015flar\u0131 \u2022 1-5. b\u00f6l\u00fcmler art\u0131k be\u015fer a\u015fama: 12 b\u00f6l\u00fcmde 67 a\u015fama \u2022 G\u00fcn\u00fcn G\u00f6revi: her g\u00fcn herkese ayn\u0131 yeni bir a\u015fama \u2022 Ni\u015fanlar: avlu duvar\u0131nda on iki ni\u015fan \u2022 Serbest Talim alt\u0131nda Ku\u015fatma, At\u0131\u015f Alan\u0131 ve \u00c7ar\u015f\u0131 At\u0131\u015f\u0131 \u2022 Yeni te\u00e7hizat: yeni yaylar, r\u00fczg\u00e2rda az sapan oklar ve her yeni unvan\u0131n kaftan\u0131 \u2022 A\u015fama a\u00e7\u0131klamalar\u0131nda toplanan ok\u00e7uluk notlar\u0131 \u2022 At\u0131\u015f\u0131n hissi: \u00e7eki\u015fte ve b\u0131rak\u0131\u015fta titre\u015fim, vurulan malzemeye g\u00f6re ses, esneyen yay kollar\u0131, uzun at\u0131\u015flarda ok kameras\u0131 \u2022 Yeni g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcm: dokulu ta\u015f ve ah\u015fap, yumu\u015fak g\u00f6lgeler, ak\u015fam ve y\u0131ld\u0131zl\u0131 geceler, ku\u015flar, seyirciler ve ok atan usta \u2022 Etkinlik Modu: ziyaret\u00e7i oyununu kurum se\u00e7er (klasik talim ya da alt\u0131 oyundan biri) ve Etkinli\u011fi Ba\u015flat ile ba\u015flat\u0131r \u2022 Bir\u00e7ok d\u00fczeltme", "created_date": 1790767990, "id": "1318543728011801", "version": "2.0", "version_code": 9, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1311024525430388", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1318543728011801"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1452651830061379"}]}, "change_log": "Version 1.0", "created_date": 1790542075, "id": "1314211351778372", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 8, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1311024525430388", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1318543728011801"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "